<title>CHINA: China Jan-May crude oil imports up 33.7 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-May crude oil imports up 33.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 11.71 million tonnes of crude oil in January-May, a rise of 33.7 percent compared with the year-ago period, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>	 IMPORTS JAN-MAY     MAY	   YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Oil     11.71 million    1.8 million	 +33.7</p>
<p>	 EXPORTS JAN-MAY     MAY	   YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p>	    8.45 million    2.15 million	+24.5</p>
<p>Note: Figures in tonnes</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
